      "summary": "The thesis highlights Deckers Outdoor as a high-quality, debt-free consumer discretionary powerhouse trading at an attractive valuation discount after a ~50% price drop caused by macro and tariff fears. Operating with industry-leading ~20% net profit margins, over $1.4 billion in annual free cash flow, and ROIC exceeding three times WACC, Deckers maintains a narrow economic moat via its flagship UGG and HOKA brands. The author emphasizes that near-term market anxiety over supply chain and tariff risks creates a compelling margin-of-safety entry point for a proven long-term compounder.",
